@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix ctorg: <http://purl.org/ctic/infraestructuras/organizacion#>.

<http://data.fundacionctic.org/vocab/infraestructuras/organizacion_20130424.html> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/format> [rdfs:label "HTML" ; 
